olid\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"image\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"engenn1le03ob07img06.jpg\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"green\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"printed\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"image\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"engenn1le03ob07img07.jpg\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"gray\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"dotted\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"image\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"engenn1le03ob07img08.jpg\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border instruction_table_background\"}"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Do you like my yellow pillow?  (before the noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "The bedroom is green and blue. (after the verb to be)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "The walls are light gray. (after the verb to be)"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "These are words you use to talk about objects."}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "gray"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a combination of white and black"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: This carpet is big and gray \u2026 like an elephant!"}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn1le03ob07aud06"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "blue"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "color of the sky and the sea"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I like the dark blue and white together."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn1le03ob07aud02"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "clean"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "not dirty"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Your kitchen is very clean."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn1le03ob07aud03"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "dotted"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "patterned with small circles"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Do you like this dotted notebook?"}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn1le03ob07aud05"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "dark"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "strong color"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I like the dark colors in this classroom."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn1le03ob07aud04"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "golden"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "the color of gold (similar to yellow)"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: These golden pillows are beautiful!"}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn1le03ob07aud07"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "pillow"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "an object you put under your head to sleep"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: This golden pillow is beautiful! "}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn1le03ob07aud08"}]}, {"type": "objectives", "contents": [{"type": "primary", "content": "Accurately use basic information in simple situations."}, {"type": "secondary_1", "content": "Understands basic information in English texts according to the communicative topics of this level."}, {"type": "secondary_2", "content": "Completes simple dialogues by the addition or selection of appropriate language according to the communicative functions of this level. "}, {"type": "secondary_3", "content": "Understands basic information in English texts according to the communicative topics of this level."}, {"type": "secondary_4", "content": "Understands basic information in English texts according to the communicative topics of this level."}, {"type": "secondary_5", "content": "Understands basic information in English texts according to the communicative topics of this level."}, {"type": "secondary_6", "content": "Completes simple dialogues by the addition or selection of appropriate language according to the communicative functions of this level. "}, {"type": "secondary_7", "content": "Understands basic information in English texts according to the communicative topics of this level."}, {"type": "secondary_8", "content": "Understands basic information in English texts according to the communicative topics of this level."}]}, {"type": "background_image", "content": "engenn1le03ob07re1img01.jpg"}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "With a partner, look on the internet for clothing from 5 different countries. "}, {"type": "text", "content": "Look for countries in Europe, Africa and Asia."}, {"type": "text", "content": " Describe the colors you see on the clothing."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Describe the patterns you see."}]}, {"type": "takeaway_assessment", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "I find clothing from different countries."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I describe clothing using colors."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I describe clothing using patterns."}]}], "type": "sena"}